cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "eu25games2019: A cleaned three-wave EU elections survey (2019) across 25 countries"
abstract: >-
  A harmonized, individual-level dataset from a three-wave survey fielded across
  25 EU member states around the 2019 European Parliament elections, including an
  embedded conjoint experiment, together with the full from-scratch data-cleaning
  pipeline used to produce it. Party-name variables are linked to Party Facts.
  The underlying survey data were designed and collected by Hahm, Hilpert, and
  König for their study of partyism and coalition partnership in Europe
  (American Political Science Review, 2024; doi:10.1017/S0003055423000266); this
  record reprocesses and extends those data with a documented, reproducible
  cleaning pipeline.
